Unnamed includes exercise reference data derived from third-party sources.

free-exercise-db
----------------
Exercise names, instructions, and image references in data/exercise_library.json
are derived from the free-exercise-db project:

  https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db

free-exercise-db is released under the Unlicense (public domain dedication).
The data has been normalized and corrected into Unnamed's canonical schema by
data/build_exercise_library.py.
